{"id":"connectors-test","title":"Connectors in context","description":"Выбери связку для логичного предложения.","level":"B1","tags":["vocabulary"],"questions":[{"id":"q1","prompt":"It was raining; ___, we went for a walk.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"however"},{"id":"b","text":"therefore"},{"id":"c","text":"because"}],"correctOptionId":"a","explanation":"However вводит контраст."},{"id":"q2","prompt":"The shop was closed; ___, we came back later.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"in addition"},{"id":"b","text":"therefore"},{"id":"c","text":"whereas"}],"correctOptionId":"b","explanation":"Therefore показывает результат."},{"id":"q3","prompt":"I enjoy sport. ___, I go swimming twice a week.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"For instance"},{"id":"b","text":"However"},{"id":"c","text":"Therefore"}],"correctOptionId":"a","explanation":"For instance приводит пример."},{"id":"q4","prompt":"Tea is warm, ___ juice is usually cold.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"whereas"},{"id":"b","text":"therefore"},{"id":"c","text":"in addition"}],"correctOptionId":"a","explanation":"Whereas сравнивает два противоположных факта."},{"id":"q5","prompt":"The course is short. ___, it is practical.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"In addition"},{"id":"b","text":"However"},{"id":"c","text":"Therefore"}],"correctOptionId":"a","explanation":"In addition добавляет ещё одну идею."}]}
